{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（眠い──……\r\nいやでも書類整理……──！）","trans":"（好困——……\n不行，还得整理文件……——！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（……ああ……この企画の返事もしないとだよな……\r\n……『告白』か、『罵倒』か……──？）","trans":"（……啊啊……这个企划也得回复才行……\n……“告白”还是“责骂”……——？）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（……どういう……──────…………\r\n……だめだ、まとまらない……とにかく、ねむ──……）","trans":"（……什么情况……——————…………\n……不行，理不清……总之，好困——……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800580010","name":"透","text":"おーい\r\n起きろー","trans":"喂——\n起来——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"っ……！？","trans":"唔……！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800580020","name":"透","text":"会えた\r\nまた","trans":"见到你了\n又一次","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え……！？\r\n君は……異世界の……","trans":"诶……！？\n你是……异世界的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800580030","name":"透","text":"迷ってるんでしょ？\r\n『告白』と『罵倒』","trans":"你在犹豫吧？\n“告白”和“骂倒”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800580040","name":"透","text":"決めよ\r\nゲームで","trans":"来决定吧\n用游戏","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902800580050","name":"透","text":"勝ったら『告白』\r\n負けたら、『罵倒』────","trans":"赢了就“告白”\n输了就，“骂倒”————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}